            <td class="px-6 py-4">定制西装、国潮旗舰店、化妆品</td>
            <td class="px-6 py-4">南京东路与静安；见我们的<a href="/zh/cities/shanghai-guide/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">上海指南</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
            <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">深圳</td>
